date: 2025-11-11T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Anti-Zorbon Taskforce is a group that meets in the sewers beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]]. Its members fashion hats out of tinfoil to keep the Zorbon out of their minds, and they keep them folded away when out in the open. [[Org/Amber Call/People/Mr. Whiskers|Mr. Whiskers]] was a proud member and was called its head. Whiskers told the Party of a meeting of the taskforce; it was set for an evening during the endless rain, and the small open-air market that holds the way down into the sewers was closed when they arrived.

The Party went down through the market's manhole anyway, under the eye of the honey seller [[People/Cora Honeysap|Cora Honeysap]], and found the taskforce's hideout wrecked. Something strong and clever had killed the people there, torn them apart, and carried the bodies away down an underground river. No bodies remained and there was no sign of a struggle. The taskforce were homeless people who lived in the sewers rather than on the streets, and by the looks of the hideout around ten of them had been there. Whiskers' things were among the belongings left behind. Two robed spellcasters and three pale hunched creatures came upon the hideout afterward, rifling through a boat and the dead's belongings; the Party killed all but one of them.
